{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"导出范畴"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"导出范畴"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Abel范畴","text":"Abel 范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal A$ 的<strong>导出范畴</strong>是万有的以 $\\mathcal A$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"t-结构","text":"心"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定无穷范畴","text":"稳定 $\\infty$-范畴"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>导出范畴也可视为"},{"Local":{"url":"生象化","text":"生象化"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定化","text":"稳定化"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>导出范畴的一个"},{"Local":{"url":"数学对象的表现","text":"模型"}},{"Plain":"是将链复形之间的"},{"Local":{"url":"拟同构","text":"拟同构"}},{"Plain":"视为同构, 即对拟同构作"},{"Local":{"url":"局部化","text":"局部化"}},{"Plain":".\n此时 $\\mathcal A$ 中的对象可视为聚集在 $0$ 位置的链复形.</p>\n<p>相关讲义: "},{"Local":{"url":"homalg-2-der-cat","text":"导出范畴"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>泛性质</h3>\n<p>参考 "},{"Local":{"url":"LurieHA","text":"HA"}},{"Plain":" 1.3.3 节.</p>\n<h3>模型</h3>\n<p>设 $\\mathcal A$ 为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Abel范畴","text":"Abel 范畴"}},{"Plain":". 记 $W$ 为 $\\mathcal A$ 中"},{"Local":{"url":"拟同构","text":"拟同构"}},{"Plain":"的全体, 定义导出范畴 $\\mathsf{D}(\\mathcal A)$ 为局部化\n$$\r\n\\mathsf D(\\mathcal A) := \\mathsf {Ch}(\\mathcal A)[W^{-1}].\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>在 $\\mathcal A$ 为 "},{"Local":{"url":"GrothendieckAbel范畴","text":"Grothendieck Abel 范畴"}},{"Plain":"的前提下, $\\mathsf {D}(\\mathcal A)$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定∞-范畴","text":"稳定无穷范畴"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3>$t$-结构</h3>\n<p>导出范畴带有自然的 "},{"Local":{"url":"t-结构","text":"$t$-结构"}},{"Plain":". 链复形 $X= (X_\\bullet)$ 代表的对象的截断分别为</p>\n<p>同调指标:</p>\n<p>$$\r\n\\tau_{\\leq n}X = (\\cdots\\to 0\\to \\operatorname{coker}d_{n+1}\\to X_{n-1}\\to\\cdots),\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\tau_{\\geq n}X = (\\cdots\\to X_{n+1}\\to \\operatorname{ker}d_{n}\\to 0\\to\\cdots).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>上同调指标:</p>\n<p>$$\r\n\\tau^{\\geq n}X = (\\cdots\\to 0\\to \\operatorname{coker}d^{n-1}\\to X^{n+1}\\to\\cdots),\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\tau^{\\leq n}X = (\\cdots\\to X^{n-1}\\to \\operatorname{ker}d^{n}\\to 0\\to\\cdots).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n"}]}}